      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Originally a logging and ferrying stop, it soon transformed into a center for farming and viniculture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://intelligentdeco.com/a-comprehensive-guide-to-clarksburg-ca/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Visitors can explore the historic Bogle Winery and learn about its family heritage, or stroll along charming streets to experience community spirit.",
